      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emden%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today, the Rail Splitter Wind Farm stands near Emden, showcasing the village’s role in Illinois’ renewable energy landscape.",
